<title>NETHERLANDS: SARAKREEK CUTS NET LOSS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>SARAKREEK CUTS NET LOSS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BAARN, Netherlands 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Total net loss			 1.0  vs   5.9</p>
<p>    Operational loss		     1.0  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (dollars)    5.01 vs   3.30</p>
<p>NOTE - Sarakreek Holding NV is a Dutch-based property group</p>
<p>which invests in real estate in the U.S.</p>
<p>U.S. investment group Westbrook Real Estate Fund L.P.,</p>
<p>formerly known as Tiger Real Estate Fund L.P., owns a</p>
<p>controlling stake in the Dutch firm.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
